{"step_index":262,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T13:17:29Z","thinking":"Reviewing the documentation requirements, it is apparent that a comprehensive `README.md` file needs creation. The necessary sections, as outlined, cover various aspects including the project's overview, features, technology stack, and architectural details. Additional sections will detail module boundaries, database schema, authentication, AI integration, resume generation, template rendering, and payment processes.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"# CareerOS: AI-Powered Career and Consultation Platform\\n\\nAn enterprise-grade, full-stack career platform featuring an **interactive ChatGPT-style AI career assistant**, a **structured multi-template AI resume builder with Tiptap editor**, and **verified 1-on-1 expert consultation bookings with Stripe payment integration, Google Calendar synchronization, and automated email confirmations**.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Project Overview\\n\\nCareerOS bridges advanced generative AI capabilities with real-world professional coaching workflows:\\n1. **Secure Multi-Role Authentication**: JWT stored in HTTP-Only cookies with Argon2/bcrypt password hashing and role-based access control (`USER`, `ADMIN`, `CONSULTANT`).\\n2. **AI Career Assistant**: ChatGPT-style persistent coaching conversations supporting the STAR behavioral method, system design prep, and offer negotiation.\\n3. **Structured AI Resume Builder**: Lossless structured resume authoring with Tiptap rich-text formatting and live switching between **Modern Professional** and **ATS Classic** templates.\\n4. **ATS Machine-Readable Output**: Semantic HTML hierarchy for high parseability, keyword extraction, and instant export/PDF printing.\\n5. **Concurrency-Guarded Consultation Engine**: Prevents double-bookings and past bookings with compound database constraints.\\n6. **Stripe Payments with Webhook Idempotency**: Server-side pricing enforcement, cryptographic HMAC signature validation, and event ledger idempotency.\\n7. **Calendar & Email Orchestration**: Automated Google Meet link creation and Nodemailer email delivery, designed with graceful failure isolation (payment success is preserved even if third-party APIs encounter outages).\\n8. **Real-time Analytics Dashboard**: Server-side MongoDB aggregation pipeline returning user-scoped resume metrics, active chat sessions, and upcoming consultations.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Technology Stack\\n\\n### Frontend\\n- **Framework**: Next.js 14+ (App Router, Server & Client Components)\\n- **Language**: TypeScript (Strict mode)\\n- **Styling**: Tail\n<truncated 11844 bytes>","Description":"\"Create comprehensive README.md documentation\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\PRIYANKA\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\scratch\\\\career-platform\\\\README.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing README.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Create README.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
