{"step_index":286,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-13T13:24:15Z","content":"# AI-Powered Career and Consultation Platform\n\nThe **CareerOS Platform** has been fully implemented, tested, and built. It is a complete, production-oriented full-stack web application with Next.js 14 App Router on the frontend, Express.js with TypeScript and Mongoose on the backend, persistent MongoDB database schemas, LLM integration, Stripe Checkout with webhook idempotency, Google Calendar synchronization, automated email confirmations, and automated test coverage.\n\nThe project is located at:\n`C:\\Users\\PRIYANKA\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\career-platform`\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> It is recommended to set `C:\\Users\\PRIYANKA\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\career-platform` as your active workspace directory in your editor or terminal.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Summary of Implemented Features\n\n### 1. Authentication & User Profile Management\n- Secure user registration and login with bcrypt password hashing.\n- Token-based authentication using JSON Web Tokens (JWT) issued in **HTTP-Only cookies** (`token`) with Bearer header fallback.\n- Role-based authorization (`USER`, `ADMIN`, `CONSULTANT`).\n- Comprehensive profile management: Headline, biography, contact info, skills, education, work experience, projects, and certifications.\n- Protected frontend routes and backend APIs with resource ownership verification.\n\n### 2. AI Career Assistant (ChatGPT-Style Coach)\n- Persistent multi-turn conversations stored in MongoDB ([`ChatSession`](file:///C:/Users/PRIYANKA/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/career-platform/backend/src/modules/chat/chat.model.ts) and [`ChatMessage`](file:///C:/Users/PRIYANKA/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/career-platform/backend/src/modules/chat/chat.model.ts)).\n- Real-time conversation context preservation (STAR interview method, salary negotiation strategies, system design coaching).\n- Session management: Create new chats, rename sessions with inline modals, switch between threads, and delete sessions.\n- Pluggable AI provider abstraction ([`llm.ts`](file:///C:/Users/PRIYANKA/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/career-platform/backend/src/integra\n<truncated 17289 bytes>\ngn, and raw text readability. However, because enterprise applicant tracking parsers vary widely across vendors (Workday, Taleo, Greenhouse, Lever), universal 100% parsing fidelity cannot be mathematically guaranteed across all proprietary engines.\n3. **Local Development Adapters**: When API keys are not supplied for OpenAI, Stripe, Google Calendar, or Nodemailer, development adapters return deterministic mock data with explicit log markers.\n\n---\n\n## 10. Completed Acceptance Checklist\n\n- [x] Full-stack application runs with separated frontend and backend architectures.\n- [x] MongoDB connectivity with indexes, unique constraints, and multi-tenant scoping.\n- [x] Secure registration, login, logout, and HTTP-only cookie authentication.\n- [x] User profile management with complete career metadata.\n- [x] AI career assistant supporting persistent, multi-thread conversations.\n- [x] Complete Resume CRUD with structured data storage.\n- [x] AI section generation and refinement integration.\n- [x] Both Modern Professional and ATS Classic templates implemented losslessly.\n- [x] Tiptap rich-text editor integrated with bidirectional state synchronization.\n- [x] Resume live preview, print-to-PDF, and HTML export.\n- [x] Consultant directory with real-time calculated slot availability.\n- [x] Concurrency protection preventing double-booking and past appointments.\n- [x] Stripe Checkout integration with backend-calculated pricing.\n- [x] Stripe webhook processing with raw HMAC signature verification.\n- [x] Webhook idempotency ledger tracking processed event IDs.\n- [x] Google Calendar integration adapter with meeting URL generation.\n- [x] Email confirmation notifications with failure isolation.\n- [x] Real-time dashboard analytics populated from MongoDB aggregations.\n- [x] Server-side pagination, search, sorting whitelist, and status filtering.\n- [x] OpenAPI / Swagger documentation rendered at `/api/docs`.\n- [x] All 16 automated API tests executed and passing.\n- [x] Clean TypeScript and Next.js production builds verified with zero errors.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
